            ("Austin Regional Supplement", ["Employees based at the Austin sales office are remote-first. They meet customers in person where useful, use the Austin co-working space as needed, and follow the US public holiday calendar. All other parts of this policy and of the Code of Conduct, Acceptable Use and Information Security policies apply, subject to local law."]),
            ("Compliance", ["Regardless of work mode, every employee must follow all Zenvora policies, including the Leave Policy, Code of Conduct, Acceptable Use Policy and Information Security Policy. Failure may lead to action under the Progressive Discipline Policy (ZEN-POL-004)."]),
